---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import { PRE_LAUNCH_MODE, business, launchStatus } from '../data/business';
import FinalCTA from '../components/FinalCTA.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Our Locally Owned Company"
  description="Meet Leo Afonso, owner of Resolve Junk Solutions in Lancaster County and a currently serving Pennsylvania Air National Guard member."
  crumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'About', url: '/about' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">LOCAL ROOTS. STRAIGHTFORWARD VALUES.</p>
      <h1>
        Good work starts
        <br />
        with giving a care.
      </h1>
      <p>
        We’re building Resolve Junk Solutions around a simple idea: getting rid
        of unwanted things shouldn’t mean chasing someone for answers.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="story-grid page-content">
      <Photo />
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>
          A practical background.
          <br />A personal approach.
        </h2>
        <p>
          Resolve is locally owned and operated by {business.owner.name}, who{' '}
          {business.owner.service}. He’s building the company around clear
          communication, preparation, and personal responsibility for the work.
        </p>
        <p>
          Leo’s technology and software background helps with the practical
          details: keeping requests organized and customers informed. Junk
          removal is hands-on work, but the details around it matter too:
          understanding the request, agreeing on a plan, and respecting the home
          you’ve been invited into.
        </p>
        <p>
          {PRE_LAUNCH_MODE
            ? `${launchStatus} Lancaster County is the center of our planned service area.`
            : 'Resolve provides junk removal and cleanouts in Lancaster County, with coverage confirmed for each property.'}
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="story-grid page-content">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>More room for what matters.</h2>
        <p>
          Family is part of why we’re building this business. We know a home is
          more than the things in it, and that letting some of those things go
          can be a big step.
        </p>
        <p>
          Sometimes it’s a couch. Sometimes it’s a whole room. Either way, the
          goal is the same: make the process clear, treat people well, and
          follow through on the agreed work.
        </p>
        <p>
          {PRE_LAUNCH_MODE
            ? 'We’re preparing for launch. As the company gets moving, this space will feature our own truck, family, and real work.'
            : 'As the company grows, this space will feature our own truck, family, and real work.'}
        </p>
      </div>
      <Photo kind="family" />
    </section>
    <div class="section">
      <FinalCTA />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
